# Syntax Error Checklist

## Pipe Errors

- [x] Pipe at the beginning of input `| command`
- [x] Pipe at the end of input `command |`
- [x] Consecutive pipes with no command in between `command || command or command | | command`
- [x] Empty command between pipes `command | | command`
- [x] exit(2)

## Redirection Errors

- [x] one redirection `<` `>` `<<` `>>`
- [x] Missing filename after input redirection `command < `
- [x] Missing filename after output redirection `command > `
- [x] Missing filename after append redirection `command >> `
- [x] Missing delimiter after heredoc `command <<`
- [x] Multiple consecutive redirections of the same type without filenames `command > > file`
- [x] exit(2)

## Quote Errors

- [x] Unclosed single quote `command 'unclosed`
- [x] Unclosed double quote `command "unclosed`

## Command Structure Errors

- [x] Empty command (just spaces or empty string)
- [x] Command ending with a redirection operator without a target
- [x] Missing command name before redirection (< input)

## Special Operators

- [ ] Unsupported special characters `(;, \, &&, ||, etc.)`
- [ ] Invalid variable names after $ (e.g., containing special characters)

## Heredoc-specific Errors

- [x] Unclosed heredoc (EOF reached before delimiter)
- [x] Invalid delimiter formatting

## File Path Errors

- [x] Empty filename after redirection (command > "" or command > '')
